# ==============================================================================
# GUIA DE DEPLOY:
# 1. DEPLOY SERVERLESS (Vercel / Netlify / Cloud Run):
#    - Vercel: Conecte o repositório git e defina as variáveis de ambiente no painel. O arquivo vercel.json já está configurado.
#    - Netlify: Conecte o repositório. O arquivo netlify.toml com @netlify/plugin-nextjs cuidará do build.
#    - Cloud Run / Container Serverless: Execute 'gcloud run deploy --source .' (utilizará o Dockerfile multi-stage automaticamente).
#
# 2. DEPLOY SERVIDOR DEDICADO (VPS / Docker / PM2 / Linux):
#    - Docker Compose: 'docker compose up -d --build'
#    - PM2: 'npm run build && pm2 start npm --name "portal-news" -- run start'
#    - Standalone (menor consumo de RAM/disco): 'npm run build && npm run start:standalone'
#    - Healthcheck endpoint ativo em: /api/health
# ==============================================================================
